flowchart TB
    Start([Start Command]) --> Parse[Parse Envelope]
    Parse --> ContextCheck{Context valid}
    ContextCheck -- no --> DeniedA[Return denied invalid_context]
    ContextCheck -- yes --> PolicyCheck{Membership and lifecycle pass}
    PolicyCheck -- no --> DeniedB[Return denied policy_violation]
    PolicyCheck -- yes --> Route[Route to module service]
    Route --> Execute[Execute domain operation]
    Execute --> Emit[Emit domain event]
    Emit --> DriftCheck{Drift detected}
    DriftCheck -- yes --> Recover[Run recovery and projection restore]
    Recover --> Notify[Emit invalidation or recovery event]
    DriftCheck -- no --> Notify
    Notify --> Respond[Return terminal envelope]
    DeniedA --> End([End])
    DeniedB --> End
    Respond --> End
